| description = In North Freeport can be found the Hall of Truth.  Here followers of the Lightbearer Mithaniel Marr gather.  Clerics under the guidance of Eestyana Naestra work alongside Paladins guided by Veleron Dushire.  It is these Knights who keep North Freeport safe and actively oppose the Freeport Militia and their allies the Dismal Rage.  Nearby is the Temple of Marr dedicated to the Queen of Love, sister to the Lightbringer.  The Knights of Truth support these Priests of Marr and the Steel Warriors in the nearby Warrior's Guild called The Bunker in West Freeport.

